{"id":"n71365-5-3","stage":0,"title":"차다 · 甩","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71365-5-3-1","ko":"남자 친구가 갑자기 나보고 헤어지재.","zh":"我男朋友突然说要跟我分手。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"남자","meaning":"男（与 친구 合为男朋友）","explanation":"남자：男性；남자 친구 连用是“男朋友”，不能按字面拆成普通的男性朋友。","readings":[{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60865","senseId":"3","lemma":"남자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}},{"text":"친구가","meaning":"男朋友","explanation":"남자 친구 整体表示“男朋友”；-가 标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구가","audio":"/audio/61bf5bfb043d2161ceed.mp3"}},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子。","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"나보고","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；보고：口语中标明说话、行动针对的人：“对、向”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나보고","audio":"/audio/2838c43b85ab3b31bdef.mp3"}},{"text":"헤어지재.","meaning":"分手，分开，走开","explanation":"헤어지다：分手，分开，走开；재：-자고 해 的缩略，转述他人一起行动的提议。","readings":[{"term":"헤어지다","audio":"/audio/55df2acaad2147f202aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58271","senseId":"2","lemma":"헤어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"헤어지재","audio":"/audio/c3e271f583135d94356b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c6a3b6d97217b4d8","term":"남자","zh":"男性（남자 친구 合指“男朋友”）","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3","entryId":"60865","definition":"男性（남자 친구 合