94fc46db6b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71365","senseId":"5","lemma":"차다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찬","audio":"/audio/e3d8eeabff7c4506e9b3.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c6a3b6d97217b4d8","term":"남자","zh":"男性（남자 친구 合指“男朋友”）","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3","entryId":"60865","definition":"男性（남자 친구 合指“男朋友”）","pronunciation":["남자"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友（남자 친구 为男朋友）","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"친구 单独表示朋友；与 남자 连用时，남자 친구 指男朋友。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"d8eb940a7794fc46","term":"차다","zh":"甩，甩掉，抛弃","audio":"/audio/d8eb940a7794fc46db6b.mp3","entryId":"71365","definition":"(粗俗)恋人关系的男女双方中其中一方单方面解除关系。","pronunciation":["차다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/3778cfa0e7d1500f073b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.58,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71365","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"5","sourceLevel":"초급","day":23,"sequenceScore":0.9588,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你被男朋友甩了？","你要去哪儿？","我男朋友突然说要跟我分手。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你被男朋友甩了？","我男朋友突然说要跟我分手。","你要去哪儿？"],"answer":0}]}
